      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Selected data source\nClick a **data_source** above. First/latest event and totals follow the time picker; whether the host is alive right now is on **Host Heartbeat**. Trend and outliers use the last **24 hours** at 15-minute buckets vs that source's `streamstats` mean \u00b1 `exec_health_sigma` (default 2). **DROP** = sudden traffic loss. **BURST** = sudden spike. Empty panels mean nothing is selected yet.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
